<title>UK: Waterschapsbank sets 300 mln guilder 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Waterschapsbank sets 300 mln guilder 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEDERLANDSE WATERSCHAPSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    14.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.825   PAY DATE    14.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.15     SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMSTERDAM PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-     SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETHS     HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.75 PCT DSL DUE 2007 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
